{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TingBase</strong> is a competitive online PvP game that fuses the intensity of first-person shooters with the depth of MMO combat.<br>Choose from unique classes\u2014Tank, Healer, AR, and more\u2014each wielding powerful hitscan weapons and over 20 abilities inspired by classic RPG combat. Every match is a high-stakes clash where aim, strategy, and ability management decide victory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Shooter Precision</strong> \u2013 All weapons are pure hitscan; no random spread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>MMO-Inspired Abilities</strong> \u2013 Queue abilities, shield allies, heal teammates, or unleash devastating AoE attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Team Battles</strong> \u2013 6v6 matches where synergy and coordination are as important as aim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Prototype First, Expand Later</strong> \u2013 Starting small with core maps, modes, and classes before scaling up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a sharpshooter or a strategist, TingBase delivers a hybrid combat experience where reflexes and tactics collide. Add it to your wishlist and join the fight early!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086630?t=1761156183","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086630?t=1761156183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086630/977c2a4e342966562340bb0416396c2599ab2f17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761156183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086630/977c2a4e342966562340bb0416396c2599ab2f17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761156183","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id"